  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rG3fvJP/Lucky-Blocks-Race.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1129\" height=\"95\"></strong></span></h2>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f90\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VD7f4Pn/A-simple-race-along-with-a-Pv-P-at-the-end.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1129\" height=\"33\"></span></h2>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>信息！</strong></em></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>此地图支持 2-8 名玩家！</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一张有趣的地图，你的<strong>运气</strong>将决定你的<strong>游戏！</strong></span><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>与</strong>你的朋友竞争，看看谁是最<strong>幸运的！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span>在这张地图中，你会发现一条充满幸<strong>运方块</strong>的赛道，<strong>蓝色</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>玩家必须开始游戏</strong>，到达终点</span><span>，在那里</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你会找到一个基地来装备自己，从而进入<strong>PVP！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">而<strong>最后</strong>存活的人将<strong>获胜！</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">包含<strong>重生点</strong>，以免你感到沮丧！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此地图专为<strong>版本 1.16.5</strong>设计</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此地图上仅使用经典的<strong>幸运方块</strong>。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">地图照片</span></em></span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/768/2022-07-25_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"269\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4YQSMmq/This-map-requiere-mod.png\" width=\"1507\" height=\"70\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模组版本：</strong>Lucky Block Forge/Fabric 1.16.5-8.0 或更高版本</span><br><em><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block</a></span></strong></em></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">点击此处享受 25% 折扣</span><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e786a9cc-b379-4f61-b906-ed81aeb57024.png\" width=\"1351\" height=\"224\"></a></h2>\n<hr>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>作者：</strong></em></h6>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>El_this_boy</strong><br>- <strong>Twitch</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/el_this_boy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.twitch.tv/el_this_boy</a><br>- <strong>Twitter</strong>: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Elthisboy2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/Elthisboy2</a><br>- <strong>Instagram</strong>: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finstagram.com%252fel_this_boy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://instagram.com/el_this_boy</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">贡献者：</span><br></strong><br>- Anto_niapaz &lt;3</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>- Oreozukiztrukiz2&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>- felix__owo</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>- juan__458</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>- Matiskyper</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-maartina<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>- wiwi_124<br>- Soydylan01</em></span><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span><strong>西班牙语评测</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">(西班牙语)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>4:12</strong></span><br></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><em><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dqXqFvRj3Vc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br>好吧... 这里展示的地图是同一个，但经过修改！<br>@locochon&nbsp;<br>至少你用了我的基础地图作为制作素材吧 :(((</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><em><span><span><iframe style=\"width:387px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/k8yVPerF6iU\" width=\"387\" height=\"217\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
